    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2631" root="بص" body-key="b">[
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَصٌّ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَصُّ نَارٍ</span>, <i>Live coals;</i> because they
shine, or glisten: n. un. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>: so in the present
day; but probably only post-classical: or, accord.
to the TA, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بصو</span>, the word <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَصَّةٌ</span> is used by
the vulgar, for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَصْوَةٌ</span>.]

